{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15172","headline":"春日晋祠同声会集得疎字韵 · 李益","name":"春日晋祠同声会集得疎字韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风壤瞻唐本，山祠阅晋余。\n水亭开帟幕，岩榭引簪裾。\n地绿苔犹少，林黄柳尚疎。\n菱苕生皎镜，金碧照澄虚。\n翰苑声何旧，宾筵醉止初。\n中州有辽雁，好爲系边书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15172.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15172","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}